		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "a04c686d-f800-43e8-9c79-d8b9e772132a")
		(at 105.005 134.32 90)
		(descr "HRL DP-08RP, 8-position right-angle piano DIP switch, LCSC C458097. Body 21.88 x 9.61 x 9.41mm standing on the board, piano keys on the vertical face protruding 2.40mm past it. Geometry measured from the manufacturer drawing's own vector paths (scaled by its 7.62mm pin-row dimension), not estimated: the body is CENTRED on the two pin rows, 0.994mm beyond each -- it does not stand flush to the front row. Holes dia 0.97+-0.05 -> 1.0mm drill. Keys align with the pin columns and sit on the pins 1-8 row. Replaces the stock top-slide SW_DIP_SPSTx08_Slide footprint, whose body and 3D model misrepresent this part.")
